1c:T8c3,<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=""><pre style="background-color:#22272e;color:#adbac7" tabindex="0" data-language="ts" data-theme="github-dark-dimmed"><code data-language="ts" data-theme="github-dark-dimmed" style="display: grid;"><span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">import</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> { createClient } </span><span style="color:#F47067">from</span><span style="color:#96D0FF"> "@adityadev13/solvix"</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">;</span></span>
<span data-line=""> </span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">const</span><span style="color:#6CB6FF"> client</span><span style="color:#F47067"> =</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB"> createClient</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">({</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">  tracing: { enabled: </span><span style="color:#6CB6FF">true</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> },</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">});</span></span>
<span data-line=""> </span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">await</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> client.</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB">get</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">(</span><span style="color:#96D0FF">"/users"</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">);</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#768390">// Request header: traceparent: 00-4bf92f3577b34da6a3ce929d0e0e4736-00f067aa0ba902b7-01</span></span></code></pre></figure>
<h2 id="how-it-works">How It Works</h2>
<p>Each request generates a W3C <code>traceparent</code> header in the format:</p>
<pre><code>00-{traceId}-{spanId}-01
</code></pre>
<ul>
<li><strong>traceId</strong> — same across all retries of the same request</li>
<li><strong>spanId</strong> — new for each attempt (retries get a new span)</li>
<li><strong>01</strong> — trusted trace flag</li>
</ul>
<p>The <code>traceId</code> is also available in <code>res.meta.traceId</code> for correlation with your tracing backend.</p>
<h2 id="use-with-opentelemetry">Use With OpenTelemetry</h2>
<p>The <code>traceparent</code> header is compatible with OpenTelemetry and any W3C Trace Context-aware system:</p>
<ul>
<li>Datadog</li>
<li>Jaeger</li>
<li>Zipkin</li>
<li>AWS X-Ray</li>
<li>Grafana Tempo</li>
</ul>11:[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Distributed Tracing"}],["$","$L1b",null,{"html":"$1c"}]]
